gro-uk:ApprenticeRate rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf cco:Resource ;
                      rdfs:label "Apprentice Rate" ;
                      skos:definition "The apprentice rate of pay as referenced in UK apprenticeship regulations." .


###  https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/uk#ApprenticeRateResource
