                      rdfs:subClassOf cco:Role ;
                      rdfs:label "Apprentice Role" ;
                      skos:definition "The role of an apprentice aged 16-18 undertaking a level 3 or higher apprenticeship" ,
                                      "The role of an apprentice eligible to receive a bursary." ,
                                      "The role of an apprentice in the UK apprenticeship system." ,
                                      "The role of an apprentice in the UK regulatory context." ,
