                                          "A bursary provided to eligible apprentices who are care leavers, as defined in paragraphs 108 and 110 of the relevant regulation." ,
                                          "A bursary specifically for care leavers participating in apprenticeships." ,
                                          "A one-off financial bursary provided to eligible care leaver apprentices." ,
                                          "A tax-free payment to acknowledge the additional financial burden that care leavers encounter when living in, or leaving, care, and not treated as income in Universal Credit calculations." ,
                                          "Care leavers’ bursary is an additional £3,000 payment (paid in 3 instalments) that we pay to apprentices who are in care or are care leavers, and who started their apprenticeship training on or after 1" ;
