                    rdfs:subClassOf cco:Organisation ,
                                    cco:Role ;
                    rdfs:label "Main Provider" ;
                    skos:definition "An organisation responsible for the completion of apprenticeship training." ,
                                    "An organisation that acts as a main provider in the context of UK regulatory provisions." ,
                                    "An organisation that acts as a main provider in the context of apprenticeship co-investment collection and reporting." ,
                                    "An organisation that acts as a main provider in the context of apprenticeship funding and ILR submissions." ,
                                    "An organisation that acts as a main provider in the context of apprenticeships." ,
                                    "An organisation that acts as a main provider in the context of subcontracting, responsible for publishing specific information on their website." ,
                                    "An organisation that acts as a main provider of apprenticeship training under UK funding rules." ,
                                    "An organisation that acts as a main provider of training and end-point assessment services." ,
                                    "An organisation that acts as the main provider in the context of apprenticeship funding and administration." ,
                                    "An organisation that is a main provider of education or training services." ,
                                    "The main provider responsible for ensuring apprentice preparation for end-point assessment." ,
                                    "We use the term ‘main provider’ where the funding rule only applies to an organisation that is listed on the main provider route of the Apprenticeship Provider and Assessment Register (APAR)." ;
                    prov:wasDerivedFrom data:UK_UNIT_00022 .


